1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,184
Hey everyone, welcome back to Car Service
Podcast.

2
00:00:03,534 --> 00:00:06,318
I'm Sam, and today we're talking timing
belts.

3
00:00:06,668 --> 00:00:08,996
Our guest just had his replaced at Golden
Horse.

4
00:00:09,346 --> 00:00:12,106
Welcome, Ahmed — thanks for joining us.

5
00:00:12,455 --> 00:00:14,759
Thanks, glad to be here.

6
00:00:15,109 --> 00:00:16,741
So, what brought you in?

7
00:00:17,091 --> 00:00:20,571
The engine started a weird ticking at high
revs.

8
00:00:20,921 --> 00:00:23,345
Ticking? That sounds serious.

9
00:00:23,695 --> 00:00:26,815
Yeah, I'd been putting it off for months.

10
00:00:27,165 --> 00:00:28,005
How did you book?

11
00:00:28,355 --> 00:00:33,155
Online, golden‑horse.ae, picked a slot for
Saturday.

12
00:00:33,505 --> 00:00:34,633
Easy process?

13
00:00:34,982 --> 00:00:39,158
Super smooth, got a confirmation text
instantly.

14
00:00:39,508 --> 00:00:41,500
What was the workshop like when you
arrived?

15
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:46,578
Clean, organized, Al Quoz 3, Warehouse 4.

16
00:00:46,928 --> 00:00:48,104
Professional vibe?

17
00:00:48,454 --> 00:00:51,814
Absolutely, the techs greeted me by name.

18
00:00:52,164 --> 00:00:53,772
Walk us through the diagnosis.

19
00:00:54,122 --> 00:00:57,674
They ran a quick scan, showed the belt was
cracked.

20
00:00:58,024 --> 00:01:00,064
Cracked belt — classic sign.

21
00:01:00,413 --> 00:01:02,717
They explained the risk of a snap.

22
00:01:03,067 --> 00:01:03,907
What did they do?

23
00:01:04,257 --> 00:01:07,929
Replaced the belt, tensioner, and water
pump.

24
00:01:08,279 --> 00:01:09,335
All in one go?

25
00:01:09,685 --> 00:01:12,805
Yes, they said it saves labor later.

26
00:01:13,155 --> 00:01:14,235
How long did it take?

27
00:01:14,585 --> 00:01:17,825
About three hours, maybe a bit more.

28
00:01:18,175 --> 00:01:19,927
Did they give you a price upfront?

29
00:01:20,276 --> 00:01:25,820
They quoted 1500 AED, no hidden fees.

30
00:01:26,170 --> 00:01:27,202
No surprises?

31
00:01:27,552 --> 00:01:30,360
None, the invoice matched the quote.

32
00:01:30,710 --> 00:01:32,246
How does the car feel now?

33
00:01:32,596 --> 00:01:35,764
Smooth, the ticking is gone completely.

34
00:01:36,114 --> 00:01:37,026
Peace of mind?

35
00:01:37,376 --> 00:01:41,288
Huge relief, especially before a road
trip.

36
00:01:41,638 --> 00:01:43,438
Would you recommend Golden Horse?

37
00:01:43,787 --> 00:01:46,907
Definitely, transparent and skilled.

38
00:01:47,257 --> 00:01:48,937
Great story, thanks Ahmed.

39
00:01:49,287 --> 00:01:51,327
Now, Omar with a quick tip.

40
00:01:51,677 --> 00:01:52,589
Sure thing.

41
00:01:52,939 --> 00:01:56,539
Omar, how do Dubai roads and speed bumps
affect suspension?

42
00:01:56,889 --> 00:01:59,889
Frequent bumps load the shocks and
bushings faster.

43
00:02:00,239 --> 00:02:03,527
Heat adds stress, so inspect bushings
every service.

44
00:02:03,877 --> 00:02:04,789
Good to know.

45
00:02:05,138 --> 00:02:07,106
Warning sign of the week — Sam?

46
00:02:07,456 --> 00:02:10,720
If you hear a clunk over bumps, get your
suspension checked.

47
00:02:11,070 --> 00:02:13,782
That clunk often means worn ball joints or
mounts.

48
00:02:14,132 --> 00:02:16,316
Ignore it and you risk steering loss.

49
00:02:16,666 --> 00:02:18,298
Thanks for listening, folks.

50
00:02:18,648 --> 00:02:21,336
Book your next service at golden‑horse.ae.

51
00:02:21,686 --> 00:02:22,934
See you next episode!
